 e movie stars\, lost everything\, unleashed monsters onto the world and th
 en banded together to try and save the planet from the mayhem they had jus
 t created.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/minions-and-monsters
 \n\nEstimated start: 13:00
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
